!!VRs^cgc.tooltip.531^:S^Ember Oath

{~Lime}Ember Oath - Equipped %(count)/6{~}
Collected %(collected)/6.
Part: +5 points to all eight ACM commander modifiers.
Damage percentage always equals Health.
Full set training: +1 to all seven basic Commander stats per 12 victories survived.
Training: %(growthWins) victories; +%(growthPoints) to each basic stat (full set only).

%(bonus2)
%(bonus4)
%(bonus6)
Full set: +40 further to Attack.
Thresholds are included in the assembled relic, not added twice.

%(checklist)
Only active commander equipment grants bonuses. Backpack copies are collected, not equipped. Right-click a part with all six worn to assemble; right-click the relic to dismantle. Complete relics never drop.^;
